# TEMPLATE ONLY -- PUT NO REAL KEYS IN THIS FILE.
#
# This file is committed to git so others know which keys are needed.
# Your actual keys go in `.env`, which is gitignored.
#
#   cp .env.example .env      <- then edit .env, not this file

# --- Required ---
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Required for live Amazon + Reddit data ---
# https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations
# Without this the pipeline uses data/seed_products.json instead.
APIFY_TOKEN=

# --- Optional: Reddit via official API ---
# Reddit closed self-service signup in late 2025; new apps need manual approval
# (apply as "researcher"). Until approved, Reddit data comes via Apify above.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=truth-ranker/0.1 by u/yourusername

# --- Optional: tracing ---
# https://smith.langchain.com -- free, and makes the ~15 LLM calls per product
# inspectable when a verdict looks wrong.
LANGSMITH_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: politeness ---
# An email gets you a higher NCBI rate limit.
PUBMED_EMAIL=
